'''Baits''' are items used to provide bonuses while [[Fishing]]. They give various effects and are automatically used while fishing if they are in the inventory or [[Bait Sack]]. If the player cancels casting, Bait will be refunded. The effects of a Bait last from when the player casts their [[Fishing Rod]] until they reel it back in.

