{{/List}}

== Conserving Bait ==
Certain items provide a chance to not consume bait on use, stacking additively:
* {{Item|Bait Ring}}: {{Green|5%}} chance to not consume '''Bait'''.
* {{Item|Spiked Atrocity}}: {{Green|10%}} chance to not consume '''Bait''' (takes priority over {{Item|Bait Ring}}).
* {{Ench|Caster}}: {{Green|5%}}–{{Green|30%}} chance to not consume '''Bait'''.
* {{Attr|Fisherman}}: {{Green|1%}}–{{Green|10%}} chance to not consume '''Bait'''.
* {{Item|Stingy Sinker}}: {{Green|10%}} chance to not consume '''Bait'''.

This results in a maximum {{Green|60%}} chance to not consume '''Bait'''.

== Trivia ==
*The textures of '''Bait''' items include different containers based on the item [[Rarity]].
**{{Rarity|Common}} Baits resemble a wooden bucket.
**{{Rarity|Uncommon}} Baits resemble a metal bucket.
**{{Rarity|Rare}} Baits resemble a darker metal bucket.

